DELETE /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai/finetunes/{finetune_id}
Delete a finetune. Any in-flight requests referencing the lora will fail after the files are deleted.
Required: account_id (path); finetune_id (path)

GET /client/v4/accounts/{account_id}/ai/finetunes/{finetune_id}/finetune-assets/{file_name}
Returns a pre-signed R2 URL for downloading a finetune asset file.
Required: account_id (path); finetune_id (path); file_name (path)
